OL,3,GNEWSAI'm angry my Jehovah's Witness mum
OL,4,Adied - she didn't want to 'disobey God'
OL,6,FWhen Estera Pawlak's mother Ela was    
OL,7,Fdiagnosed with stomach cancer, she was 
OL,8,Foffered potentially life-saving surgery
OL,9,Fto remove the tumour.                  
OL,11,FBut the Jehovah's Witness refused as it
OL,12,Fcould have involved a blood transfusion
OL,13,F- a procedure that was forbidden in the
OL,14,Freligion until earlier this year.      
OL,16,FEla had chemotherapy in her native     
OL,17,FPoland but nothing could keep the      
OL,18,Fdisease at bay and she died in Aberdeen
OL,19,Fin 2024, aged 63.                      
